# Apixaban + 10 DMF: XTB2 MD, spherical confinement
# Analogous to the other Apixaban Explicit10 confined XTB2 MD runs
# (Apixaban/Water/MD/Apixaban_10H2O_XTB_preequil_confined.inp,
#  Apixaban/DMSO/MD/10/Apixaban_10DMSO_XTB_preequil_confined.inp,
#  Apixaban/MeOH/MD/10/Apixaban_10MeOH_XTB_preequil_confined.inp,
#  Apixaban/Chloroform/MD/10/Apixaban_10CHCl3_XTB_preequil_confined.inp).
#
# UPDATED: now uses the real DMF-optimized Apixaban geometry
#   (Apixaban_SMD_dmf_Opt_Freq_KeepDens.xyz, r2SCAN-3c/SMD(dmf), converged,
#   no imaginary frequency, E = -1542.152113 Eh) instead of the earlier
#   placeholder (DMSO-optimized geometry). The Apixaban centroid/size came
#   out essentially identical to the other solvents' (Apixaban's own
#   conformation barely changes between continuum solvents), so the 10 DMF
#   placement and Cell Sphere parameters below are unchanged.
#
# Starting geometry: Apixaban (59 atoms, SMD(dmf)-optimized) + 10 DMF
#   molecules, each placed with its carbonyl O atom (the primary H-bond
#   acceptor site) on the same 12-direction sphere-shell pattern used
#   throughout this project, rotated so the molecule's bulk (the two methyl
#   groups) points radially outward.
#
# Apixaban centroid = (31.537, -19.865, -0.109); max atom-centroid distance
#   = 9.03 Ang (consistent with the other Apixaban Explicit10 builds).
# DMF's own extent from its O reference atom = 4.31 Ang.
# 10 DMF molecules placed at offset 12.78 Ang from Apixaban's centroid (the
#   same offset reused throughout this project for Apixaban-scale builds).
# Cell Sphere radius set to 18.0 Ang (larger than DMSO/CHCl3's 14.0 Ang,
#   since DMF's own molecular extent (4.31 Ang) is bigger than DMSO's
#   (3.78 Ang), and the original 14.0 Ang sphere was already found in
#   earlier fixes to be too tight even for DMSO at this offset).
# Checked: min DMF-Apixaban atom distance = 4.16 Ang (no clash), max atom
#   distance from the sphere center = 17.09 Ang (safely inside the 18.0 Ang
#   sphere). Total atom count = 179 (59 + 10x12), verified.

! XTB2 MD

%md
  Timestep 1.0_fs
  Initvel 298.15_K
  Thermostat NHC 298.15_K Timecon 20.0_fs
  Cell Sphere 31.537, -19.865, -0.109, 18.0 Spring 20
  Dump Position Stride 100 Filename "Apixaban_10DMF_XTB_preequil_confined.xyz"
  Run 20000
end

* xyz 0 1
